@page "/icon-browser"

<PageTitle>Font Awesome Blazor Icon Browser</PageTitle>

<div class="container-fluid mt-3 mb-4">
    <h1>Icon browser</h1>

    <p>
        The optional <code>Jenin.FontAwesome.Blazor.IconPicker</code> package ships the
        <code>IconPicker</code> component: an interop-free search box over the whole Font Awesome Free
        catalogue. It searches by icon name, alias, or keyword, filters by style, previews every result
        with the core <code>Icon</code> component, and raises the selection you can bind straight back
        to an icon.
    </p>

    <p>Install the package when your own app needs icon discovery:</p>

    <CodeSnippet Language="none">
        <Snippet>
            dotnet add package Jenin.FontAwesome.Blazor.IconPicker
        </Snippet>
    </CodeSnippet>

    <p class="mb-0">
        Registration is optional — the picker falls back to <code>IconMetadataProvider.Default</code>.
        When you do register it (recommended for apps that share one catalogue across components),
        call <code>services.AddJeninFontAwesomeIconPicker()</code> next to
        <code>services.AddJeninFontAwesome()</code>. See <a class="link-primary" href="configuration">Configuration</a>.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="icon-browser-page sample-page">
    <SampleTabs>
        <Tabs>
            <SampleTab Text="Blazor">
                <Samples>
                    <Sample CssClass="mb-5" SnippetComponent=typeof(IconPickerSnippet) Heading="IconPicker" />
                </Samples>
            </SampleTab>
        </Tabs>
    </SampleTabs>
</div>

<div class="container-fluid mt-4 mb-5">
    <h2>Parameters used above</h2>

    <table class="table table-striped align-middle">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Parameter</th>
                <th>Type</th>
                <th>Default</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><code>Value</code></td>
                <td><code>string?</code></td>
                <td><code>null</code></td>
                <td>Selected icon CSS class (<code>fa-house</code>); supports <code>@@bind-Value</code>.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>OnSelect</code></td>
                <td><code>EventCallback&lt;IconMetadata&gt;</code></td>
                <td>&mdash;</td>
                <td>Raised with the full metadata (name, label, styles, aliases, search terms).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>MaxResults</code></td>
                <td><code>int</code></td>
                <td><code>60</code></td>
                <td>Upper bound on rendered results; zero or less means unlimited.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>Style</code></td>
                <td><code>IconStyle?</code></td>
                <td><code>null</code></td>
                <td>Initial style filter; <code>null</code> shows every Free style.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>ShowLabels</code></td>
                <td><code>bool</code></td>
                <td><code>true</code></td>
                <td>Draws the human-readable label beneath each icon.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>CssClass</code></td>
                <td><code>string?</code></td>
                <td><code>null</code></td>
                <td>Extra class on the picker root; style the emitted <code>fa-icon-picker*</code> names.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
